sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Jupyter Notebook)
    participant SDK as CodeFlare SDK
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KubeRay as KubeRay Operator
    participant RayHead as Ray Head Service<br/>mTLS
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>(~/.local/share/codeflare/tls/)

    Note over User,FS: Flow 1: RayCluster Creation and mTLS Setup

    User->>SDK: Cluster(config).apply()
    SDK->>K8sAPI: POST RayCluster CR (ray.io/v1)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / OIDC
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: RayCluster created
    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: Reconcile: deploy head + worker pods
    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: Create CA Secret ({cluster}-ca-secret-{uid})

    loop Poll for CA Secret (backoff)
        SDK->>K8sAPI: GET Secret (CA cert)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Secret data (CA cert + key)
    end

    SDK->>SDK: Generate RSA 3072-bit client cert<br/>(signed by KubeRay CA, SHA-256)
    SDK->>FS: Write cert + key (permissions 0600)
    SDK->>RayHead: Connect ray://10001/TCP<br/>Auth: TLS client cert (mTLS)
    RayHead-->>SDK: Connection established

    Note over User,FS: Flow 2: RayJob Submission with Local Files

    User->>SDK: RayJob(config).submit()
    SDK->>SDK: Package local files (zip + base64)<br/>Size limit: 1MB
    SDK->>K8sAPI: POST Secret ({job}-files)<br/>with ownerRef to RayJob CR
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Secret created
    SDK->>K8sAPI: POST RayJob CR (ray.io/v1)<br/>with submitter pod template + init container
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: RayJob created
    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: Reconcile: create submitter pod
    Note right of KubeRay: Init container unzips files<br/>from Secret mount

    Note over User,FS: Flow 3: Dashboard URL Resolution (RHOAI v3.0+)

    User->>SDK: cluster.dashboard_uri()
    SDK->>K8sAPI: LIST HTTPRoutes (label: ray.io/cluster-name)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: HTTPRoute with parentRef → Gateway

    alt Gateway hostname found
        SDK->>K8sAPI: GET Gateway CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Gateway spec (listeners, addresses)
    else Fallback: Routes
        SDK->>K8sAPI: LIST Routes (for Gateway)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Route hostname
    else Fallback: GatewayConfig
        SDK->>K8sAPI: GET GatewayConfig CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Domain + subdomain config
    end

    SDK->>RayHead: GET https://{hostname}/ray/{ns}/{name}<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, Auth: Bearer Token
    RayHead-->>SDK: Dashboard response
    SDK-->>User: Dashboard URL
